     : (!tf.resource) -&gt; (\cf5 tensor\cf4 &lt;\cf5 f32\cf4 &gt;, !tf.control)\
  \cf2 %2\cf4 , \cf2 %control_1\cf4  = tf.Add(\cf2 %arg0\cf4 , \cf2 %1\cf4 )\
     : (\cf5 tensor\cf4 &lt;\cf5 f32\cf4 &gt;, \cf5 tensor\cf4 &lt;\cf5 f32\cf4 &gt;) -&gt; (\cf5 tensor\cf4 &lt;\cf5 f32\cf4 &gt;, !tf.control)\
  \cf2 %control_2\cf4  = tf.AssignVariableOp(\cf2 %arg2\cf4 , \cf2 %arg0\cf4 , \cf2 %control\cf4 )\
     : (!tf.resource, \cf5 tensor\cf4 &lt;\cf5 f32\cf4 &gt;) -&gt; !tf.control\
  \cf2 %3\cf4 , \cf2 %control_3\cf4  = tf.Add(\cf2 %2\cf4 , \cf2 %arg1\cf4 )\
